   156	
   157	### It is:
   158	- **A portable framework.** Files you install into `.claude/` in your
   159	  project.
   160	- **Opinionated.** Enforces a protocol. You can customize, but not
   161	  ignore.
   162	- **Stdlib-only in Python.** Zero external dependencies in the hooks.
   163	- **Claude Code first.** A Gemini adapter stub exists, but real parity
   164	  is deferred to v2+.
   165	- **Audited.** Every spawn, every decision, every veto becomes a JSONL
   166	  event.
   167	- **Governed by ADR.** 190 ADRs document every architectural decision.
   168	
   169	### It is NOT:
   170	- **A product.** No UI, no SaaS, no login.
